    {
      "text": "把 25 多种符文自由组合成自定义法术，例如火焰符文加飞弹符文",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Craft your own spells by combining runes that you find in the world. Each rune has a unique effect on the spell. For example, combine a fire rune with a missile rune to craft a fire missile. There are more than 25 runes to mix and match between.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2676030/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "可彻底破坏体素环境，挖出秘密、捷径或绕过上锁入口",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Runehaven features a fully destructible voxel world. Destroy the environment to find secrets, shortcuts, or to bypass locked entrances.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2676030/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "模组支持自制武器、物件、生物群落与世界，并内置关卡编辑器",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Mod support for creating your own weapons, props, items, biomes and worlds. There is also an integrated level editor included with the game.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2676030/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
